(text "Audio codec, microphone and speaker output" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c2b27a31-64df-52c0-a813-3558025603b4"))
(text "TLV320AIC3100 is the I2S clock master, clocked by Y1 (12.288MHz = 256 x 48kHz); the CM5 I2S port is the clock consumer.\nOne shared clock for capture and playback keeps the echo-cancellation reference sample-accurate. I2C address 0x18.\nMK1 is a bottom-port analog MEMS mic mounted on the bottom side over a 1.0mm acoustic hole. SW4 removes microphone\npower in hardware (privacy) and GPIO27 reports the state. Class-D output: 2.5W into 4 ohm from +5V." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8f1826c8-fe50-520b-a856-2e1965e231c7"))
